  "conclusions": {
    "four_q_plus_2_alone": "The map q\u21924q+2 is injective: it contributes ZERO same-branch collisions. It is not a collision-resistant compression function by itself (wrong interface).",
    "full_T": "Canonical T is NOT collision-resistant: explicit infinite families T(3(4q+2))=T(3q+1) and T(3(2q+1))=T(3q+2). Any such pair collides under all T^k.",
    "hqh_implication": "HQH-539 collision resistance cannot rest on injectivity of T or of 4q+2. It requires the SHA3 seed (message commitment) plus finalize. Bare T collisions do not freely yield message collisions without inverting SHA3.",
